# Calculator, Edit > Paste in the scientific view: ":5F0&3C|1^FF=~<4=" (Hex by its paste code, And,
# Or, Xor, Not, Lsh), then the word sizes Word, Byte and Dword
# Reference run only (the port side is calc-paste3.w16, which puts the text on the clipboard with
# "clip"): Program Manager is the shell and WIN.INI run=calc.exe notepad.exe; Notepad opens
# SYSTEM\cp3.txt (holding the text), selects and copies it and closes, then Calculator pastes.
shot
key alt
type fo
shot
type system\cp3.txt
key enter
shot
key alt
type ea
key alt
type ec
key alt
type fx
shot
key alt
type vs
shot
key alt
type ep
shot
key f3
shot
key f4
shot
key f2
shot
